  "narrative": {
    "key_bets": [
      "Stellarator confinement improvement factor H = 1.3 above ISS04 transfers from W7-X (QI) experimental performance to HESTIA's heliotron geometry",
      "Continuous helical WISE REBCO coils can be wound at reactor scale (R₀ = 7.8 m) with kilometer-class unbroken conductor lengths and no demountable joints",
      "sCO₂ Brayton power conversion achieves >50% thermal efficiency at 800–1200 K coupled to a liquid metal primary loop — load-bearing for Q_eng = 2.0 at Q ~13",
      "Tin-indium-lead-lithium liquid metal blanket with 80 at.% Li-6 enrichment achieves TBR > 1.0 in heliotron geometry (3D neutron transport not yet completed)",
      "Novel non-magnetic high-Mn alumina-forming austenitic structural steel performs adequately under 14 MeV neutron irradiation despite no industrial production or nuclear qualification baseline",
      "60 × 250 GHz / 1 MW CW gyrotrons can be developed (technology does not currently exist at this frequency-power-CW combination)",
      "Fleet manufacturing of 70–103 MWe modular units yields NOAK economics that overcome the inherent high specific capital cost (~$143B/GWe inflation-adjusted FOAK)"
    ],
    "eliminated_costs": [
      "Current-drive recirculating power — stellarator inherently steady-state with zero current-drive overhead vs. tokamaks (10–30% gross electric)",
      "Plasma restart and pulsed-operation cycling losses — ~1-year continuous burn eliminates restart costs of pulsed concepts",
      "Liquid helium refrigeration at 4 K — HTS coils at 20 K with gas helium cooling dramatically reduce helium consumption vs. LTS designs",
      "In-vessel robotic blanket replacement — 90 modular LM blanket modules designed for crane access through upper ports without robotic in-vessel entry",
      "Solid first-wall replacement — integrated LM first-wall/divertor eliminates one major replacement category"
    ],
    "novel_costs": [
      "Continuous helical WISE REBCO coil winding — unbroken kilometer-scale conductor runs in 3D helical geometry with no fallback if a long-run tape fails during winding",
      "Tin-indium-lead-lithium liquid metal blanket alloy with 80 at.% Li-6 enrichment — novel chemistry, indium supply constraint (~900 t/yr global production), highest Li-6 enrichment in the portfolio",
      "250 GHz / 1 MW CW gyrotron development — technology does not exist; 60 units required at ~40 MW wall-plug",
      "Non-magnetic high-Mn alumina-forming austenitic structural steel — new material requiring parallel invention, qualification, and industrial-scale production",
      "Solar H₂ production system for HTS magnet cooling (liquid H₂ at 20 K) and startup power — unique integration with no parallel in other concepts"
    ],
    "risks": [
      {
        "description": "Published cost (~$10B inflation-adjusted for 70.4 MWe, ~$143B/GWe) implies LCOE in the $1.75–1.85/kWh range; framework lower bound (~$1,160/MWh) cannot reproduce this anchor and is a structural underestimate",
        "severity": "high"
      },
