        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "Liquid metal blanket pump power explicitly flagged as 'quite unknown' in primary source — directly affects Q_eng with tight recirculating budget at 70 MWe",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "TBR > 1.0 unconfirmed — 3D neutron transport calculation not completed; complex heliotron geometry with coil intrusions may not achieve self-sufficiency even at 80 at.% Li-6",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "250 GHz / 1 MW CW gyrotron technology does not exist (TRL 1–2) and cannot be substituted with available lower-frequency hardware without redesigning the plasma operating point",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "H = 1.3 confinement assumption transferred from W7-X (quasi-isodynamic) to HESTIA's heliotron geometry — center-peaked ECH profiles, alpha confinement, and turbulent transport may not transfer; H = 1.0 fallback inflates machine size and capital",
        "severity": "medium"
